// Enemy sprites, included in grafika.cpp. They all face left, towards the knight.
// Empty space around a grid gets trimmed off, and the enemy's size (SkalaOrka) is just its height / 20.
//  paleta: "letter:r,g,b ..." (K is the outline unless you set it, '.' is see through)
//  ruka:   the pixel where the hand holds the weapon (for the hellhound it's the jaw)
//  vrat:   first row below the head, pojas: first row of the legs. Head and body "breathe" by moving
//          a pixel, the head a bit after the body, while the legs stay put.
//  porub:  from this row down the robe or cloak sways a little (0 if there's no robe)
struct NeprijateljSprite {
    const char* paleta;
    int rukaX, rukaY;
    int vrat, pojas, porub;
    std::vector<const char*> redovi;
};

